    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>The Responsive <strong>Slider Gallery</strong> plugin allows you to create and manage image slideshows on your WordPress site. It functions as a straightforward <strong>slideshow creator</strong>, enabling you to upload photos, arrange them, and display them as a <strong>responsive slider</strong>.</p>\n<p>This tool is designed for users who need a functional <strong>slider</strong> that works across different devices, including mobile phones, tablets, and desktop computers. You can add the gallery to posts, pages, or widget areas using a generated shortcode.</p>\n<p><strong>Main Features:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Responsive Slider:</strong> The layout adapts automatically to screen width.</li>\n<li><strong>Drag &amp; Drop Ordering:</strong> Sort your slide images easily in the admin panel.</li>\n<li><strong>Batch Upload:</strong> Add multiple images to your <strong>Slider Gallery</strong> at once.</li>\n<li><strong>Shortcode Implementation:</strong> Place your slideshow anywhere on your site.</li>\n<li><strong>Custom Settings:</strong> Adjust width, height, and navigation styles.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This plugin focuses on usability, providing a clean interface to build a <strong>Slider Gallery</strong> without complex configuration. It integrates directly with the WordPress media library for image management.</p>\n<h3>How To Use Plugin ?</h3>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"Responsive Slider Gallery - How To Use Responsive Slider Gallery Plugin\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b2sA3mNTxUc?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h4><strong>Check Plugin Demo</strong></h4>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-standard/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Responsive Slider Gallery Free</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://awplife.com/wordpress-plugins/responsive-slider-gallery-wordpress-plugin/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Upgrade To Premium Plugin</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Responsive Slider Gallery Premium</a></strong></p>\n<h4>SLIDER PREMIUM FEATURES AND DEMO</h4>\n<blockquote>\n<h4><strong>Demo for Lite and Pro Version</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/\" title=\"Responsive Image Slider\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Responsive Image Slider</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/slider-with-sidebar/\" title=\"Slider With Sidebar\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider With Sidebar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/slider-with-custom-width-height/\" title=\"Slider With Custom Width &amp; Height\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider With Custom Width &amp; Height</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/slider-navigation-styles/\" title=\"Slider Navigation Styles\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider Navigation Styles</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/full-screen-style/\" title=\"Full Screen Style\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Full Screen Style</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/slider-transition-style/\" title=\"Slider Transition Style\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider Transition Style</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/slider-with-text-on-slide/\" title=\"Slider With Text On Slide\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Slider With Text On Slide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/demo/responsive-slider-gallery-premium/how-to-test-premium-plugin/\" title=\"Try Admin Demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Try Admin Demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://awplife.com/account/signup/responsive-slider-gallery\" title=\"Get Premium Version\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Get Premium Version</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>Major features in standard slider plugin include:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Responsive Slider Design</li>\n<li>Slider Customization</li>\n<li>Sidebar Widget Slide Show</li>\n<li>Footer Widget Slide Show</li>\n<li>Full-Screen Slide Show</li>\n<li>Many Customization Settings</li>\n<li>Embed Slider Into any your theme template</li>\n<li>Standard WordPress Import and Export</li>\n<li>Slide Navigation</li>\n<li>Cross Browser Compatibility</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Install Responsive Slider Gallery either via the WordPress.org plugin directory or by uploading the files to your server.</p>\n<p>After activating Responsive Slider Gallery, go to plugin menu.</p>\n<p>Click Add New Gallery and upload image slides.</p>\n<p>Publish the slider gallery and copy slider gallery shortcode from the bottom of the slider setting and embed shortcode on any Page/Post/Text Widget.</p>\n<p>That&#8217;s it. You&#8217;re ready to go!</p>\n",
